This addon is a configuration distribution that replicates the UI setup
of the [Seoyaksun] character. It depends on, but does NOT include, the
following addons (which retain their own respective licenses):

  - ElvUI            by Elv     (https://github.com/tukui-org/ElvUI)
  - ElvUI_BenikUI    by Benik   (https://github.com/Benik/ElvUI_BenikUI)

